<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Oct car registrations rise 20 pct - industry.</title>
<headline>Swedish Oct car registrations rise 20 pct - industry.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car registrations rose 20 percent to 19,961 vehicles in October, industry body AB Bilstatistik said on Friday.  </p>
<p>So far this year new car registrations have totalled 147,080 cars, an increase of five percent over the first 10 months of 1995, Bilstatistik said.</p>
<p>Official statistics will be released by Statistics Sweden at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
